<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A simple macro for the Digimon Master Online game with auto farm and only hit digimon target

Setting:
line 9 for digimon health
line 11 for type of digimon (drag to the digimon skin)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 50 100 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 50 ms
GoColor 7 2 129,34,24 236,78,59 2 970 56 4 7 1 0
Goto 12
GoColor 9 1 71,50,102 180,169,238 2 990 25 49 49 1 0
Goto 12
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 100 300 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>